":{"summary":"Republican Gov. Greg Abbott, seeking a third term, leads Democratic state Rep. Gina Hinojosa by low single digits in most October polls, with Emerson at 49 to 45, though a few surveys show Hinojosa narrowly ahead. The race centers on property taxes, affordability and public schools, with Abbott declining to debate and Hinojosa suing over his office's emails with Elon Musk.","issues":[{"issue":"Property taxes","why":"A 12 million dollar Abbott ad buy says Hinojosa voted more than 40 times for higher property taxes, which she denies, while she says ending corporate welfare could cut them.","src":"https://www.kut.org/politics/2026-10-02/texas-governor-race-abbott-hinojosa-attacks"},{"issue":"Public schools","why":"Hinojosa would fire Education Commissioner Mike Morath and pause A through F ratings, while Abbott pledges to make Texas first in public education.","src":"https://texasstandard.org/stories/gina-hinojosa-greg-abbott-texas-governor-race-priorities-polls/"},{"issue":"Cost of living","why":"Hinojosa proposes returning rainy day fund money above 10 billion dollars, about 1,500 dollars per household, and Abbott runs an affordability agenda tour.","src":"https://texasstandard.org/stories/gina-hinojosa-greg-abbott-texas-governor-race-priorities-polls/"},{"issue":"Crime and the border","why":"Abbott, backed by the National Border Patrol Council and police groups, calls Hinojosa soft on crime and illegal immigration.","src":"https://www.nbcdfw.com/news/politics/lone-star-politics/voters-to-abbott-and-hinojosa-battle-for-votes-in-the-texas-governor-midterm-election/4092042/"},{"issue":"Data centers and the grid","why":"Analysts say the data center boom and economic worries are headwinds for Republicans, and Abbott pledges more energy market competition.","src":"https://www.kut.org/politics/2026-10-02/texas-governor-race-abbott-hinojosa-attacks"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Emerson poll has Abbott up 4","date":"2026-10-22","what":"Emerson found Abbott at 49 and Hinojosa at 45 among likely voters, with Hinojosa gaining but Abbott still favored.","helps":"R","kind":"national","src":"https://www.courthousenews.com/poll-puts-talarico-a-step-ahead-of-paxton-in-race-for-us-senate/"},{"title":"Hinojosa sues over Musk emails","date":"2026-10-19","what":"Hinojosa sued in Travis County for unredacted emails between Abbott's office and Elon Musk, and Abbott's campaign called it a baseless act of desperation and said it handed over all required records.","helps":"mixed","kind":"attack","src":"https://www.aol.com/articles/abbott-musk-emails-spark-lawsuit-121721000.html"},{"title":"Labor and teachers back Hinojosa","date":"2026-10-16","what":"Hinojosa has the Texas AFL-CIO and Texas AFT, while Abbott has Trump and major police and border agent groups.","helps":"mixed","kind":"endorsement","src":"https://www.nbcdfw.com/news/politics/lone-star-politics/voters-to-abbott-and-hinojosa-battle-for-votes-in-the-texas-governor-midterm-election/4092042/"},{"title":"Empty lectern at the Governor's Mansion","date":"2026-10-15","what":"Hinojosa staged a debate with an empty podium for Abbott, who was with East Texas law enforcement and said showing up in communities matters most.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.fox7austin.com/news/texas-governors-race-greg-abbott-misses-debate-against-gina-hinojosa"},{"title":"Polls tighten through October","date":"2026-10-13","what":"A UT Texas Politics Project poll had Hinojosa up 49 to 48 while most other October polls showed Abbott ahead by 1 to 5 points.","helps":"mixed","kind":"national","src":"https://www.aol.com/articles/abbott-musk-emails-spark-lawsuit-121721000.html"},{"title":"Abbott ramps up attacks","date":"2026-10-02","what":"Abbott launched a 12 million dollar property tax ad and posted an altered image accusing Hinojosa of wanting gender transition camps in schools.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"https://www.kut.org/politics/2026-10-02/texas-governor-race-abbott-hinojosa-attacks"}],"events":[{"title":"Debate or no debate","prompt":"The challenger has accepted four debate invitations and the governor has declined them all. What does the campaign do?","issue":"other","src":"https://www.nbcdfw.com/news/politics/lone-star-politics/voters-to-abbott-and-hinojosa-battle-for-votes-in-the-texas-governor-midterm-election/4092042/","opts":[{"label":"Empty podium stunt","say":"Stage a debate outside the mansion and say he cannot defend his record.","pos":-0.6,"trump":-0.4,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Agree to one debate","say":"Accept a single televised debate to settle the question and return to issues.","pos":0,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Stay on the road","say":"Skip debates and keep meeting voters with local police and community leaders.","pos":0.6,"trump":0.4,"tone":"calm"}]},{"title":"Property tax votes","prompt":"A 12 million dollar ad says the Democrat voted over 40 times for higher property taxes, which she calls out of context. What is the property tax message?","issue":"econ","src":"https://www.kut.org/politics/2026-10-02/texas-governor-race-abbott-hinojosa-attacks","opts":[{"label":"End corporate welfare","say":"Cut property taxes by ending corporate tax breaks and refund the rainy day surplus.","pos":-0.7,"trump":-0.4,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Targeted relief","say":"Raise homestead exemptions and cap appraisals without big new programs.","pos":0.2,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Eliminate school taxes","say":"Use state money to wipe out local school property taxes and require votes on tax hikes.","pos":0.8,"trump":0.5,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"Musk emails","prompt":"A lawsuit seeks the governor's office emails with Elon Musk, whose PAC is spending heavily in Texas races. How does the campaign play it?","issue":"corruption","src":"https://www.aol.com/articles/abbott-musk-emails-spark-lawsuit-121721000.html","opts":[{"label":"Billionaire influence","say":"Argue Texas is run for billionaires and demand full release of the e